message: Cite this software for the harness; cite the LogHub papers for the data and metrics.
title: LogParser-Harness
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-03"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/TMFNK/LogParser-Harness
authors:
  - name: MbitAI
    website: https://www.mbitai.com
abstract: >
  Reproducible Drain baseline on LogHub-2k with an Apache-2.0 implementation
  of the LogHub-2.0 metrics GA, PA, FGA, and FTA.
references:
